{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/103-lu-ling-ling/fangyurun-yuanshi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/103-lu-ling-ling/fangyurun-yuanshi/data.json","title":"诗经原始(上下) · 盧令令 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 齊風 · 盧令令 · 汇集《诗经原始(上下)》关于《盧令令》的 4 条注释，含 4 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"103-lu-ling-ling","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/103-lu-ling-ling/fangyurun-yuanshi","poem":{"id":"103-lu-ling-ling","title":"盧令令","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"qifeng","path":["風","齊風","盧令令"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"盧令令","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"其人美且仁","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"盧重環","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"其人美且鬈","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"盧重鋂","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"其人美且偲","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi","title":"诗经原始(上下)","authors":["方玉润","李先耕"],"contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","era":"清","publicationYear":1986,"carrier":"EPUB"},"stats":{"annotationCount":4,"glossCount":4},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"刺好田也。","targetNotes":"篇首题注。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 篇首题注。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"题注"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"右《盧令令》三章，章二句。《小序》謂「刺荒也」。《大序》曰：「襄公好田獵畢弋而不修民事，百姓苦之，故陳古以風焉。」襄公好田而死於田，事見《春秋傳》，故當刺。然此詩與公無涉，亦無所謂「陳古以風」意。蓋游獵自是齊俗所尚，詩人即所見以咏之。詞若歎美意實諷刺，與《還》略同。當以《集傳》爲是。但彼以馳逐爲能事，此以聲容爲美觀。作法又各不同耳。","targetNotes":"总评原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 总评段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"总评"}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"盧田犬也。〔孔氏穎達曰〕犬有田犬、守犬。《戰國策》云：「韓國盧，天下之駿犬。東郭逡，海内之狡兔。韓盧逐東郭，俱爲田父之所獲。」是盧爲田犬也。令令犬頷下環聲。〔董氏逌曰〕《韓詩》作「盧泠泠」。《説文》引《詩》作「獜」。重環子母環也。鬈《説文》：「髮好貌。」鋂〔許氏慎曰〕鋂，大鎖也。偲〔《集傳》〕偲，多鬚之貌。《春秋傳》所謂「于思」，即此字，古通用耳。","targetNotes":"集释原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集釋"}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"令八庚。仁十一真。通韻。環十五删。鬈一先。轉韻。鋂十灰。偲四支。通韻。","targetNotes":"标韵原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 标韵段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"標韻"}]}]}}}
